GRCh38-2020-A_features.tsv.gz (not included: copied from a GEO deposit with no stated licence, so it is not redistributed
here). Download it into this folder before running 00_deposited_input.py (HRA003613) and 03_annotation.py:

  GEO GSE316482, sample GSM9453841, file GSM9453841_HC01_scRNAseq_all_cells_features.tsv.gz (a Cell Ranger output; all 21
  samples' features files are identical), saved as GRCh38-2020-A_features.tsv.gz; uncompressed md5
  283dc7ac5095a6dfbf8267dc1359757d

The 36,601 features (Ensembl ID, symbol, type) of the 10x Genomics Cell Ranger reference GRCh38-2020-A, in Cell Ranger's
order. HRA003613 names genes by these symbols made unique in the same order (R make.unique: a repeated symbol gets ".1");
the file recovers each gene's Ensembl ID. 03_annotation.py uses it to map CellTypist's older gene symbols.
